  "answer": "<p>We need to solve the following:\n        <svg width=\"69.669\" height=\"12.208\" viewBox=\"369.735 271.115 52.251 9.156\" class=\"displayed_equation\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g font-family=\"NagwaMath\" font-size=\"13.5\"><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"369.282\">6</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"378.172\">4</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"384.83\">5</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"391.487\">2</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"401.131\">÷</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"412.751\">4</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"419.409\">.</text></g></svg></p><p>There are many methods of dividing numbers. We will use an area model to decompose the dividend into multiples of the divisor.</p><div class=\"h-scroll\"><img class=\"displayed-image\" src=\"474162479638.01.svg\" /></div><p>We have\n        <svg width=\"188.311\" height=\"12.688\" viewBox=\"325.435 271.115 141.233 9.516\" class=\"displayed_equation\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g font-family=\"NagwaMath\" font-size=\"13.5\"><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"324.591\">1</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"333.481\">0</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"340.139\">0</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"346.796\">0</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"356.44\">+</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"369.122\">6</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"375.78\">0</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"382.438\">0</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"392.081\">+</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"404.75\">1</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"411.408\">3</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"421.804\">=</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"435.227\">1</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"444.117\">6</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"450.775\">1</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"457.432\">3</text><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"464.09\">.</text></g></svg></p><p>Therefore,\n        <svg width=\"131.035\" height=\"12.208\" viewBox=\"346.721 271.115 98.276 9.156\" class=\"displayed_equation\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g font-family=\"NagwaMath\" font-size=\"13.5\"><text y=\"280.099\" x=\"346.268\">6</text><text y=\"280.0